2869:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to control the UART.
2870:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_ReceiverTimeout_Config() API allows to configure the receiver timeout value on th
2871:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_EnableReceiverTimeout() API enables the receiver timeout feature
2872:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_UART_DisableReceiverTimeout() API disables the receiver timeout feature
2873:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_EnableMuteMode() API enables mute mode
2874:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_DisableMuteMode() API disables mute mode
2875:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_MultiProcessor_EnterMuteMode() API enters mute mode
2876:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_SetConfig() API configures the UART peripheral
2877:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_AdvFeatureConfig() API optionally configures the UART advanced features
2878:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) UART_CheckIdleState() API ensures that TEACK and/or REACK are set after initialization
2879:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableTransmitter() API disables receiver and enables transmitter
2880:Drivers/STM32H5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32h5xx_hal_uart.c ****      (+) HAL_HalfDuplex_EnableReceiver() API disables transmitter and enables receiver
